WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.480
Tsurugi!

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:10.020
What happened to you?

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:13.910
Matsukaze, I need you to practice a certain technique with me.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:14.990
Technique?

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.790
Fire Tornado Double Drive.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:22.450
It's based off the original Fire Tornado, with even more power as a combo technique.

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:24.670
Fire Tornado?

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:27.480
Isn't that Gouenji-san's hissatsu technique?

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.250
Why do you want to practice that move?

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:32.190
This is the key to winning the championship.

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:34.170
We'll practice it while keeping it a secret from everyone else.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:37.970
All right.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:46.590
Do it again!

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:47.520
Yeah!

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:58.720
Do whatever it takes to have it ready for the finals.

00:00:58.910 --> 00:00:59.910
Yeah!

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:52.270
Over here!

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:53.700
Okay!

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:57.150
Nishiki-senpai!

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:58.570
Kageyama!

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:04.290
All right!

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:05.560
That was great, Hikaru!

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:08.820
That was a solid combo play.

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:10.630
Everyone's in good shape!

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:16.000
Okay, that's all for today's practice!

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.620
We're doing it today too.

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:29.470
Those two...

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:35.300
Sorry for having you do all the troublesome investigation.

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:36.510
It's okay.

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:40.740
We finally have proof of Fifth Sector's criminal acts.

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:42.720
Midorikawa.

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:43.580
Yes, sir.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:54.730
As we thought, Fifth Sector has been running illegal activities through economic and administrative outlets.

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:56.860
So it's true.

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:59.250
That's not all we found.

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:05.800
During our investigation, we found several top-secret files.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:10.780
They all share a common codename.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.450
That codename is Dragon Link.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.400
We're still looking into the details.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:22.100
But it's likely hiding something very important.

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:25.170
Dragon Link...

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:29.030
Nishiki-senpai!

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:30.540
All right!

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.200
Defense, stop them!

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.260
Nice clear!

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:46.210
Kurama-senpai!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:52.510
All right, the team is coming together.

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:54.430
Things might work out at this rate.

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:58.030
Everyone's working hard and keeping Tenma motivated.

00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:59.680
You can do it, Captain Tenma!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.650
It's going pretty well.

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:05.360
He's fine as captain now that he's tried it.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:12.200
But you're the same as ever...

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:17.250
The finals is tomorrow, at last.

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:22.350
Make sure you stay in good condition so that you can play at your best tomorrow.

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:23.010
Yes, sir!

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:26.240
Let's go, Tsurugi.

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:29.470
We'll master it today for sure!

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:35.290
One more!

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:44.880
It's such a hard technique to pull off.

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:45.930
Keep going!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:47.700
Tsurugi...

00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:51.870
Yeah!

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:17.420
Why won't it work?

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:23.760
Let's rest for a while.

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:33.110
Say, why did you ask me to do this technique with you?

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:41.300
You're the one who showed me the path back to soccer.

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.030
Hello.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:01.700
Yes.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:05.890
Now, at the hospital?

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:11.320
Good, that's the way.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.160
Okay.

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:14.970
Nii-san!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:16.970
Kyousuke!

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:19.600
Nii-san!

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:25.620
What happened? I suddenly got a call...

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:30.420
Kyousuke, I'm going to get the surgery.

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:36.240
We don't know who, but someone offered the funds for it.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:39.350
They want it to be used for Yuuichi-kun's operation.

00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:40.950
Then...

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.850
Then they'll fix my brother's legs?

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:45.320
Yeah.

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:48.650
If he keeps up his rehab after the operation, he'll be able to walk again.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:54.280
That's great...

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:56.950
Kyousuke.

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:59.370
That's really so great...

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:05.310
Sorry for the pain you've gone through for me all this time.

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:06.540
Don't say that.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:12.070
It'll take some time, but I'll be sure to come back to the field once more.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:21.310
Kyousuke, don't play the finals for anyone else's sake. Play for your own.

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.100
Play the soccer you love.

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:26.220
Nii-san...

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:29.270
Yeah.

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:35.280
That's great, Tsurugi.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:42.040
Tsurugi's brother said he'll do his best so that he can run again.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:46.590
I hope the day when the two of them can play soccer together comes soon.

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:48.270
I see.

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:51.300
The weight on Tsurugi's heart has finally lifted.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.220
Yes!

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:54.550
That makes me the happiest!

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:56.470
Happy, huh.

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:58.810
That's what's great about you.

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:04.770
How's the team coming?

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:07.520
Oh, right! Um...

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:08.960
Everyone's working hard!

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.260
It's in your hands, Captain.

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:14.200
Okay!

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:18.790
It's too bad.

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:21.670
I wanted to play with everyone in the finals.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:25.790
No, you're with us, Captain.

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:29.010
You've fought with us this whole time.

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:33.630
Your feelings for the team will be with us no matter where we are.

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:38.870
Yeah.

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:45.780
Great, the weather's nice.

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:48.440
Today's the day of destiny.

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:55.400
My soccer started when that man saved me in Okinawa.

00:09:57.710 --> 00:10:01.700
I've lost sight of what you're trying to do.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:06.870
<i>If you want to know the answer, win through Holy Road.</i>

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:10.810
I want to keep playing soccer freely.

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:13.400
That's why I'll fight you.

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:15.880
And I'll win.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.530
I'm off!

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:20.530
Tenma, you forgot your bag!

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:23.510
Oh, shoot!

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:32.040
Why are you getting so nervous now?

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.890
Hold yourself together, Captain.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:37.450
Then I'll be going!

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:40.610
We'll win for sure!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:42.340
Sasuke, cheer us on too!

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:45.660
Come on.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:48.270
You'll be late if you don't hurry.

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:49.040
Yeah.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:51.540
Aki-nee, be sure to come cheer us on too!

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:52.630
Of course!

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:57.060
Good luck, Tenma.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:00.750
Inazuma Eleven...

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:01.540
GO!

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.290
Inazuma Eleven...

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:22.000
GO!

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:26.310
We're finally here!

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:31.840
The match that decides Japan's best jr. high school soccer team, the Holy Road finals!

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:36.510
The match between Raimon Jr. High and Seidouzan Jr. High is about to start!

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:41.900
Here in Amanomikado Stadium, the stands are filling to the brim!

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:46.010
Sorry I'm late!

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.820
It's been a long time, Kino-san.

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:48.950
Yeah.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:52.230
I didn't have much time after sending Tenma off.

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:55.060
Tenma's a captain now.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:58.430
He looked really nervous. I wonder if he's okay?

00:12:58.430 --> 00:13:00.130
Tenma-kun, hmm?

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:03.170
He's really straightforward and energetic.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.930
Isn't he like Endou-kun?

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:13.430
Along with the hot soccer match is another battle to keep your eyes on!

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:17.900
As you all know, the Holy Emperor election is at hand!

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:22.900
Upsetting the current Holy Emperor, Ishido Shuuji's predominance,

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:27.910
Hibiki Seigou has been steadily rising in the ballots!

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:31.450
The current tally is at a complete tie!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:36.410
This finals match will decide everything!

00:13:38.890 --> 00:13:40.920
Seidouzan Eleven.

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:45.920
You are the greatest team with all of Fifth Sector instilled into you.

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:48.550
I want you to play your fullest today.

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.570
Yes, Holy Emperor.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:53.400
Everyone is in perfect condition.

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.880
It's time. Let's go.

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:57.950
Yes, sir!

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:11.350
Raimon's strength is the real thing.

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:15.580
They'll be the greatest opponent Seidouzan has ever come upon.

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:22.490
There would be no meaning to the victory if the team didn't have all of Fifth Sector instilled in them.

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:28.880
The faceoff between the greatest of managed soccer and the greatest of free soccer.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:32.720
That is what is needed to find the true form of soccer.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.180
Yes.

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:39.540
Toramaru.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:42.960
Thank you for everything you've done for me up until now.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:48.670
Thank you, Holy Emperor.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.590
Holy Emperor, huh...

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:06.420
Here you go.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:09.190
Thanks.

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:13.510
Loosen up your shoulders, Tenma.

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:16.810
Just play soccer the way you usually do.

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:19.700
Yeah.

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:28.080
So you're Raimon's captain.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:29.320
Yes.

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:32.990
I'm Seidouzan's captain, Kurosaki Makoto.

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:36.220
I'm Raimon's captain, Matsukaze Tenma.

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:40.660
We acknowledge Raimon as our greatest opponent ever.

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:43.330
Let's have a fair fight until the very end.

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:45.720
Yes!

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:50.510
Both teams have entered the stadium!

00:15:57.340 --> 00:16:01.220
Guys, this is a fight to decide the future of soccer.

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:05.020
This will decide if we'll be able to bring back real soccer.

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:09.280
So be sure to enjoy yourselves and your soccer with all your hearts!

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:11.610
Enjoy it?

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:17.120
It's what Coach Kudou told us a long time ago.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:18.790
Coach Kudou!

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:22.120
Get the #1 title in Japan with those hands!

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:24.400
Make one in with a bang!

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:26.630
With your spirited shoots!

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:27.880
Yes, sir!

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:28.970
All right!

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:31.680
Tenma, say something to get us fired up!

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:33.650
Me?

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.570
Of course you.

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:37.310
You're the captain.

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:38.770
O-Okay...

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:43.480
Um... Then...

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.040
LET'S WIN THE CHAMPIONSHIP, SHALL WE?!

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:54.910
W-What the heck was that?

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:57.710
That "shall we" doesn't do the trick, you know.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.100
S-Sorry.

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:01.830
Then one more time!

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:04.680
Let's win this, guys!!

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:06.310
Yeah!

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.770
The kickoff is almost at hand!

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:16.610
Will glory go to last year's semi-finalist, Raimon Jr. High?

00:17:16.610 --> 00:17:22.140
Or will Seidouzan show its overwhelming power even in these finals?

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:26.150
Coach Endou has broken through many a strong opponent.

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:30.650
He's up against Seidouzan's coach, Holy Emperor Ishido Shuuji!

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:34.420
What kind of match will we witness today?

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:37.660
Now this is quite the sight.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:45.480
Fire Tornado Double Drive isn't complete yet.

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:48.070
But I'm sure things will work out!

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.360
Four in the first row...

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:03.380
There's space behind them.

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:04.650
We'll aim from there first.

00:18:10.930 --> 00:18:13.570
There's the fated kickoff!

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:22.320
I can't make a pass!

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:23.340
Over here!

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:25.620
Hayami-senpai!

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:28.320
Bring it up in one move!

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:31.540
I can't!

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:33.030
There's no room to go forward!

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:36.170
Then how about here?

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:40.470
I can't go up here either.

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:42.710
No!

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:44.420
Kurosaki!

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:47.310
Kurosaki has the ball!

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:48.960
I see!

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.790
This formation is to seal off our passes!

00:18:52.430 --> 00:18:55.000
That's why they put more people up front!

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:00.110
You won't get past me!

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:01.740
You're fast.

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.580
As expected!

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:04.710
What?

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:08.130
Not good enough for me!

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:10.670
Tenma!

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:11.500
Okay!

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:13.360
Over here!

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:14.750
Kurama-se-

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:18.140
They moved back so fast!

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:20.710
You won't be able to attack easily.

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:22.840
If I can't pass...

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:27.650
Damn it...

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:31.460
If you can't pass, you can't attack.

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:35.400
That's sure something you'd expect from a striker like Gouenji.

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:39.360
These guys are so troublesome.

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:40.840
Nishiki-kun!

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:43.620
Over here!

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:44.090
Yeah!

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:47.140
Hayami!

00:19:50.970 --> 00:19:52.150
So fast!

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:55.970
Kurosaki finds a momentary gap and dives into Raimon's territory!

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:58.220
You won't get past me!

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:02.470
I'm not done!

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:07.720
Damn!

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:09.060
I've got it!

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:12.790
Sangoku blocks it!

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:15.520
Great work, Sangoku-senpai!

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:16.720
Tenma!

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:23.020
So a single strategy won't be enough after all.

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:26.670
But we're Fifth Sector's strongest team.

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:32.870
We'll win this battle and prove that the Holy Emperor's soccer is the true form of soccer!

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:37.580
Ballista Shot!

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:42.720
Goal!

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.340
Seidouzan takes the first point!

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:48.000
A beautiful shoot.

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:49.720
Damn it!

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:55.030
Um, everyone...

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:57.480
I have an idea.

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:03.440
The match resumes with Raimon's kickoff!

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:15.580
Sidewinder!

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:20.170
What?

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:22.700
Kurama suddenly makes a shoot!

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:24.930
Seidouzan is caught off guard!

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:25.970
Stop it, Masaki!

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:30.050
Shoot Break!

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:38.980
Hyuuga!

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:40.800
We're just getting started!

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:43.690
You won't get it!

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:45.530
Tenma!

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:46.450
Okay!

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:48.210
Not on our watch!

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:49.370
Koizaki! Tsutsumi!

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:50.130
Yeah!

00:21:50.560 --> 00:21:51.810
You won't trap me!

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:57.500
Soyokaze Step!

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:04.010
Matsukaze finally gets around Seidouzan!

00:22:04.330 --> 00:22:04.980
Tsurugi!

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:11.250
Death Drop!

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:16.540
Shoot Br-

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:19.370
Goal!

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:21.160
Raimon catches up!

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:22.160
All right.

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:22.590
Yes!

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:25.610
You did it! Great!

00:22:26.330 --> 00:22:28.070
Now it's gotten interesting.

00:22:29.600 --> 00:22:31.620
Great, the plan worked!

00:22:32.090 --> 00:22:34.660
